<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse spot turnover hits record in Feb.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse spot turnover hits record in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total turnover on the Budapest Stock Exchange's spot market jumped to an all-time record of 356.72 billion forints in February from 288.78 billion in January, the BSE said in its monthly report.</p>
<p>TOTAL BSE TURNOVER - (in billion forints, including double counting of sales and purchases)</p>
<p>	Shares  G.b.    C.b.    T-bills I.notes C.coupons   Total</p>
<p>1997</p>
<p> Feb 126.14  147.48    0.00     80.54   0.28    2.28     356.72</p>
<p> Jan 129.57  103.29    0.00     55.07   0.26    0.59     288.78</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p> Dec  73.27  101.95    0.00     60.80   1.92    1.35     239.29</p>
<p> Nov  57.60   45.83    0.00     66.61   0.28    2.22     172.54</p>
<p> Oct  53.84   55.44    0.00     33.09   0.54    3.02     145.94</p>
<p> Sept  43.00  34.58    0.00	9.44   0.42    3.95	91.39</p>
<p> Aug  41.95    7.69    0.00	6.21   0.56    3.47	59.86</p>
<p>July  33.34   24.90    0.00	8.30   2.54    0.95	70.03</p>
<p>June  29.99   27.98    0.53	5.13   0.26    1.60	65.48</p>
<p> May  39.63   10.76    0.00	3.84   0.33    1.20	55.76</p>
<p> Apr  29.96   16.24    0.04	1.31   0.55    0.96	49.05</p>
<p> Mar  30.01   23.70    0.00	1.96   0.21    1.15	57.02</p>
<p> Feb  31.90   27.75    0.00	5.27   0.38    0.76	66.07</p>
<p>NOTE:  G.b. = Government bonds</p>
<p>	 C.b. = Corporate bonds</p>
<p>	 I.notes = Investment notes</p>
<p>	 C.coupons = Compensation coupons</p>
<p>The equity market capitalisation grew dipped to 1,137.3 billion forints at the end of February from 1,146.1 billion forints at the end of January.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
